rge numbers with the Italian Air Force and it was superior to many of the older British fighters in the North African conflict. With its Daimler-Benz engine it could reach a top speed of 600 km/h and it was adequately armed four machine guns and two 160kg bombs. In total 1,150 aircraft were built and it was in use until 1951.","LocalizedString":"The Macchi C.202 Folgore (e. thunderbolt) was an Italian fighter aircraft developed and manufactured by Macchi Aeronautica and used during WWII by the Regia Aeronautica (Royal Italian Air Force). According to some the Folgore was one of the best wartime fighters to serve in large numbers with the Italian Air Force and it was superior to many of the older British fighters in the North African conflict. With its Daimler-Benz engine it could reach a top speed of 600 km/h and it was adequately armed four machine guns and two 160kg bombs. In total 1,150 aircraft were built and it was in use until 1951."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Expansion2019","isInPermanentPool":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnEndOfTurn"],"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_Exp_Aircraft_Medium_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Card_Blowups/AU_Exp_Aircraft_Medium_Cue.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Italy/t_macchi_202.t_macchi_202","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Darryl Legg","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/MACCHI_C_202.MACCHI_C_202","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":378.0},"historyPhotoSource":"it.wikipedia.org","historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_italy","Key":"card_unit_macchi_c202_photo","SourceString":"Macchi C.202 in flight ca 1941.","LocalizedString":"Macchi C.202 in flight ca 1941."},"historyTypeDescription":{"Namespace":"card_italy","Key":"card_unit_macchi_c202_header","SourceString":"Fighter Aircraft","LocalizedString":"Fighter Aircraft"},"